    "name": "wavvy-api",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Contract suite for wavvy-api. Public reads must answer 200 with the shared shapes; authenticated writes must reject unauthenticated callers with 401. Set privyToken to a real Privy access token to exercise the happy paths by hand, the headless run asserts the rejection paths so it needs no credentials. baseUrl defaults to http://127.0.0.1:8787. Write endpoints answer 503 instead of 401 when PRIVY_APP_ID/PRIVY_APP_SECRET are unset, so the rejection assertions accept both."
  },
